WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.239
Open a new temporary chat and upload the chapter PDF.

00:00:04.239 --> 00:00:05.186
ChatGPT reads the uploaded chapter · accelerated.

00:00:05.186 --> 00:00:08.686
Write the prompt · fast typing.

00:00:08.686 --> 00:00:09.049
Send the shortcut as the second message.

00:00:09.049 --> 00:00:11.934
ChatGPT processes the prompt and builds the widget · accelerated.

00:00:11.934 --> 00:00:15.559
Inspect the generated widget before using its controls.

00:00:15.567 --> 00:00:25.452
Write the explanation at the training station.

00:00:25.452 --> 00:00:28.747
Reveal the expected training answer.

00:00:28.747 --> 00:00:33.109
Mark the training station complete.

00:00:33.109 --> 00:00:36.403
Move to the inference station.

00:00:36.403 --> 00:00:46.450
Explain why using a definition does not prove changed weights.

00:00:46.450 --> 00:00:52.394
Reveal the expected inference answer.

00:00:52.394 --> 00:00:56.754
Mark the inference station complete.

00:00:56.754 --> 00:01:00.075
Move to the context and retrieval station.

00:01:00.075 --> 00:01:11.095
Write the retrieval explanation and the need for checking.

00:01:11.095 --> 00:01:17.081
Reveal the expected context and retrieval answer.

00:01:17.081 --> 00:01:23.024
Complete the third station and inspect overall progress.

00:01:23.024 --> 00:01:30.575
Revisit Training and inspect the saved explanation.
